description = "Independent module S7: adjoint logic — a preorder of modes with structural properties, mode-indexed propositions with up/down shifts, a usage-tracking natural-deduction checker enforcing the independence principle, computation rules and normalization for proof terms, the derived modalities (exponential, lax, S4 box) and the F-U adjunction as a Galois connection on provability"
